README (english)
--------------------------------


--------------------------------
Download
--------------------------------

* ZionOne ERP/CRM can be downloaded at sourceforge:
    https://sourceforge.net/projects/ZionOne/files
  or from ZionOne official web site:
    https://www.ZionOne.org

* Most external modules are only available on DoliStore:
    https://www.dolistore.com


--------------------------------
Install
--------------------------------

* For a Quick guide, take a look at README.md file into root directory.

* More complete documentation is also available on line on the ZionOne Wiki:
    https://wiki.ZionOne.org
